== Structure

The next chapter @related-work surveys existing Petri net analyzers and identifies the gap that this thesis aims to address.
@solution-design describes the design goals and the functional and non-functional requirements for `petrivet`,
and @implementation describes the details of the Rust implementation.
@evaluation evaluates the correctness of the library, the effect of its central design decisions, and its standing
relative to established tools, and assesses it against the requirements.
@discussion discusses the design principles that emerged and the limitations of the work, and @conclusion concludes.
